          "text": "Kabili aba, ebaninine ukufuma ku Tele Mela elyo na ku Tele Hasha, Kerubi, Adoni na ku Imeri, lelo calibanshishe ukulumbula uko amayanda ya bashibo yali, nangufye uko yatantikwe, nangu ukutilafye bena bali abena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bakwa Delaiya, abana bakwa Tobia, abana bakwa Nekoda, bali imyanda mutanda amakumi yasano na babili (652).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba kuli bashimapepo ni aba: Abana baume bakwa Hobaya, abana baume bakwa Hakosi elyo na bana baume bakwa Basilai uwabuulile umukashi wakwe ukufuma ku lupwa lwakwa Basilai umwina Gileadi no kwinikwako ishina limo line. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ebo bafwailishe amashina ya fikolwe fyabo mu fitabo lelo tabafimwene, kanshi epakubafumya pa mulongo wa bashimapepo no kubapendela pa bashasangululwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umulashi wa calo apeele icebo icakuti takuli kulya icakulya camushilo mpakafye bakakwate shimapepo uukapendula ukubomfya Urimu na Tumimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:63",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Urimi na Tumimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fintu fimo bashimapepo balebomfya pakwishiba ubufwayo bwakwa Lesa. Tacaishibwe bwino bwino ifyo balebomfya ifi fintu (Ukuf 28:30; Levi 8:8; Imp 27:21).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
