        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bonse ababwelele ukufuma mu busha bali amakana amakumi yane na yabili ne myanda itatu na makumi mutanda (42,360). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babwela pamo na babomfi abaume na banakashi abali amakana cine lubali ne myanda itatu na makumi yatatu na cine lubali (7,337), aba bena bali na bakemba abaume na banakashi imyanda ibili (200). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabalwe babo bali imyanda cine lubali na makumi yatatu na mutanda (736). Imisepela ya bapunda bakwete imyanda ibili amakumi yane na basano (245), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ingamila shabo nasho shali imyanda ine amakumi yatatu na shisano (435), elyo bapunda bali amakana mutanda imyanda cine lubali na makumi yabili (6,720).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.67"
            ]
          }
        }
